  "proof_checks": [
    "Actual g,h field substitutions and ideal permutations preserve the genus kernel; orders3/9 force trivial action on W of order dividing3.",
    "The exact g class matrix applied to prime73 yields the first base class factor, proving ordinary capitulation.",
    "Nonzero genus images prove exact order3 of the six upper primes; h-difference fixes delta and proves the three-prime product principal.",
    "Complete Smith matrices and729 divisor checks give the exact residual line and all27 literal candidate comparisons.",
    "The fixed-field map and exact discriminants prove the original L2 comparison and capitulation.",
    "The six valuations and residue-degree-one norm formula identify the ordinary-unit coset precisely."
  ],
  "scope": "E.84 computes the entire ordinary transfer from Cl(B1)=C3^2: its kernel is the first C3 factor and its image is generated by the extended prime73 of exact order3. Actual normalizer automorphisms, certified class matrices and genus equivariance prove all six ramified prime classes have exact order3 and that the product of the three primes over3 is principal. An index81 principal S-divisor lattice leaves a single explicit delta line; all27 previous candidates reduce to three actual ideal classes, each repeated9 times. The original L2 prime over3 capitulates in its unramified S-split cubic extension B2. The corrected target xi*c1 is a field norm, while c1 fails the local17 cube test; its S-unit norm fibre is reduced to a precise ordinary-unit coset."
